      <activity id="9514dee6-5451-5a6b-a8ee-f1e308b7bef2" activityNameId="0a6858f9-afba-5ec0-8821-b633ec8c22b1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diesel, burned in diesel-electric generating set, at extraction site</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diesel, burned in diesel-electric generating set, at extraction site
Generic module to estimate emissions due to the use of diesel during crude oil exploration.;
3b9ec683-d3db-30b9-b5bd-c3ea85135ec5
Diesel consumption, emissions (except SO2, Nox and CH4) and infrastructure for the use of diesel in electric generating sets. Transport to site not included.
Location:  Data for NO and US.
Technology: On site generation of electricity in diesel motor generators.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: Not known.
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: From single data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b9ec683-d3db-30b9-b5bd-c3ea85135ec5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
